## Our Values 
Other parties only wish to let our country fall, claimed by our neighbors. We reject this depressing future. We support the creation of a federal military, to defend our country, if need be, and set up a system of conscription, as to create confidence in the strength of our country.

We also seek to revitalize this stagnant economy, and restore full sovereignty to our beautiful country, not lettiing foreign countries control us, nor do we want a central government to speak for us. We believe that individual regions should have governmental power, with a strongly limited central government.


## History

Although the Alternative for Hack Club is a new party, and has not yet been able to get in to elections, I (Addy Tennies, Founder of AfHC) am a former [AVCAP (Anti Vibe Coding and PHP Party)](https://avcap.xyz) member. Despite the party being socialist, which I have now woken up to the dangers of the ideology to the economy and the citizens under it, I was still on the side of the people. I pushed for free markets, allowing citizens to take risks with their money. Similarly, I also pushed for a bill to reduce the power of the central government, removing a federal ban on Marijuana, although I was ultimately unsuccessful. The extremist left seeks for complete control of all sectors, without any power for regulation by smaller regions of the country. We will not stand for this, all our power shall stand up against this tyranny.



